  "details": "I have noticed everytime I load up vrchat in desktop mode or VR mode that anti-virus software see the Open beta as a virus and will delete a file linked to EAC launcher. Now when the anti-virus is turned off the launcher loads up perfectly fine and if you switch from open beta to normal the game also works fine with the anti-virus on.\nI have noticed I have to uninstall VRChat and delete all files to then reinstall it and place it on open beta for it to work with the anti-virus software turned on.\nThis problem only started since the new open beta and was not like this during the other open beta's which is strange.",
